+* A `texbank N NAME` map takes its textures from `core/data/texbanks/MAPNAME.bank` (slot k of the bank is texture id 56 + k).
+* Optional `MAPNAME.strings` next to the map: the level's strings, one per line (`#` comments), at most 64, 4 KB.
+* `python3 tools/packbreach.py --check` builds every pack in memory and reads each one back against the compiled map.
