diff --git a/docs/LEVELS.md b/docs/LEVELS.md
index b2938f7..295db25 100644
--- a/docs/LEVELS.md
+++ b/docs/LEVELS.md
@@ -492,3 +492,56 @@ sample. No level uses a bank yet.
   banks (they need the same pack format with sprites), the 6 songs and the SFX (47,793 of 49,152 B used:
